{
    "note": "pi 端到端演示剧本：前三条是 bash 工具调用，让 pi 连续跑三轮工具循环（真实执行 ls / echo / pwd）；最后一条是纯文本，pi 收到就收工并把这句话打印出来。所以本剧本要配 --exhausted hold 用：即使意料之外地多来一次请求，拿到的也是同一条收尾文本。压测请用 scripts/pi-scenario.json + --exhausted loop。工具名与形状按 pi 0.85.1 实测：内建工具名全小写，bash 吃 {\"command\": \"…\"}。",
    "defaults": {
        "delayMs": 10,
        "chunkDelayMs": 1,
        "chunkSize": 4
    },
    "responses": [
        {
            "message": {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "先看一眼当前目录里有什么。",
                "tool_calls": [
                    {
                        "id": "call_pi_ls",
                        "type": "function",
                        "function": {
                            "name": "bash",
                            "arguments": { "command": "ls" }
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            "finish_reason": "tool_calls"
        },
        {
            "message": {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "再打印一行标记，确认工具链路是通的。",
                "tool_calls": [
                    {
                        "id": "call_pi_echo",
                        "type": "function",
                        "function": {
                            "name": "bash",
                            "arguments": { "command": "echo llm-mock-perf-tick" }
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            "finish_reason": "tool_calls"
        },
        {
            "message": {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "接下来确认工作目录的绝对路径。",
                "tool_calls": [
                    {
                        "id": "call_pi_pwd",
                        "type": "function",
                        "function": {
                            "name": "bash",
                            "arguments": { "command": "pwd" }
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            "finish_reason": "tool_calls"
        },
        {
            "message": {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "三轮工具调用都回来了：目录列表、标记回显与工作目录路径都正常，llm-mock 的 OpenAI Chat Completions 链路验证结束。"
            },
            "finish_reason": "stop"
        }
    ]
}
